{"reviews":[{"id":"B00023J4AW-0","r":4.0,"t":"Does what it is supposed to do.","x":"This is just like the old style rain bonnets I sometimes wore as a kid (I'm a senior now).  They look ridiculous, but perfect for when it rains the day I have a hair appointment.  Since I have thick wavy hair, the last thing I want to do is get caught in a downpour as I leave the hairdresser.  I keep this in my car, and it is large enough to cover all  of my hair and part of my forehead.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-1","r":5.0,"t":"I used this product a LOT and it was so easy to keep one of these \"rain bonnets\" in my ...","x":"This blast from the past product was JUST what I was looking for!!  I am a blast from the past too!  I am outside all the time in the Spring and Summer and that includes in the RAIN!  I used this product a LOT and it was so easy to keep one of these &#34;rain bonnets&#34; in my jacket pocket!  I will be ordering more for next year.  LOVE THESE!  Great seller!  Product was as described, good quality and arrived quickly, no hassles.  Will buy from again!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-2","r":5.0,"t":"BIG ENOUGH FOR BIG HAIR","x":"I WEAR MY HAIR IN NATURAL LARGE CURLS. OLD SCHOOL ROLLER SET FOR THOSE WHO GO BACK THAT FAR. I HADN'T BEEN ABLE TO FIND A RAIN HAT TO COVER ALL OF IT WITHOUT SMUSHING IT TO MUCH. WELL, THIS ONE DOES THE TRICK. I AM GOING TO ORDER ANOTHER ONE TO KEEP IN THE CAR. I LIVE IN INDIANA, WHERE THIS IS WORN FOR AT LEAST 6 MONTHS, YES, I WEAR IT WHEN IT SNOWS TOO, ITS STILL WATER COMING DOWN.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-3","r":5.0,"t":"It ain't sexy, but it works","x":"My mom wanted these. She likes them! She can keep one in her pocket and can whip it out when the rain starts. So far it has kept her head dry and the rain our of her eyes. Do I sort of wish she had a beehive hairdo to make the look complete? 100%","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-4","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I was looking for","x":"I have a salon in Alaska and it was just what my customers wanted. Thank you., great price and great product.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2013"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-5","r":3.0,"t":"Fine but a little odd","x":"Plastic is fine - not too thick or too thin. I don't understand the odd way the ties are sewn,  and it would make more sense to me if they could be tied in a knot or bow.  But my elderly mom likes having it in her purse to protect her hair in case of rain. Please know the part at the top does not sit over your forehead but just at the top of your head.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-6","r":1.0,"t":"Rain Hat","x":"This rain hat is a little skimpy. Would like it to be longer in the back.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-7","r":3.0,"t":"A Little Small","x":"I found this scarf to be a little skimpy.  It could have a little bit more of a visor and, since my hair is long, I'd like a lot more coverage in the back.  If you have shorter hair &/or you just need something you know will keep most of your hair dry, this is the product for you.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2011"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-8","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent !","x":"Just what I needed -like good older days & it serves a great purpose as I keep in my purse. While traveling it came down heavy rain & it got me through!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-9","r":5.0,"t":"So Nostalgic","x":"My wife and daughters got a real kick out of this old-style rain kirchief.  It's nice to be able to purchase this product online.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2012"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-10","r":2.0,"t":"Rain Hat","x":"Very small, they don't cover the entire head very short in the back and front.  Save your money and buy another product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-11","r":5.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t cover as much as I would like","x":"I hate umbrellas!!!!! Needed this instead. It doesn\u2019t cover my hair as much as I would like, but it serves the purpose.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-12","r":1.0,"t":"Ludicrous","x":"It is more like a helmet than a rain cap. The \"brim\" area does'nt fold or curve down to cover the front of my hair.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-13","r":1.0,"t":"Just no","x":"Like wearing a produce bag on your head. Cheap and flimsy.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-14","r":5.0,"t":"Walmart and other places I just bought over 20 of them since she loses them and I have a quality product at a great pric","x":"my mom loves these things..she is 94 and I got so tired of wasting time going to Walgreens, Rite Aid, Target, Walmart and other places I just bought over 20 of them since she loses them and I have a quality product at a great price and it reduces my stress load","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-15","r":5.0,"t":"It works!","x":"I like this hat. It's lightweight and folds up small. I was outside at an event and it started raining. Even though no one else had an umbrella, I had my rain hat. I put it on; it was comfortable, stylish and ties tight. I also liked the visor.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-16","r":5.0,"t":"WORKS WONDERFULLY WELL","x":"What more could you ask of a rain hat.  It does a great job preventing me from looking like a drowned rat when I have to go out in the rain.  You can hardly find these anymore.  Thanks, Amazon, for carrying such a solid product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-17","r":5.0,"t":"Simple , but effective.","x":"It seems every trash day when I have to drag the trash and recycling bins out it is pouring. This hat is better than wrestling with an umbrella or the hood on a jacket. If this is all I use it for , it is well worth it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great cap to have","x":"I got this to keep in my purse for those sudden rains that come out of nowhere. Carrying an umbrella 24/7 is cumbersome, so this is much easier. Folds up nice and flat, and I can throw it on to keep my hair dry.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-19","r":5.0,"t":"Sister loved it","x":"My sister couldn't find any rain hats at the stores and this was perfect for her.  She's very happy with the product.  It was a little pricier than some others but I'm glad I chose this one.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-20","r":1.0,"t":"Damage","x":"I send it to my mom,she just open to use,and it was ripped.I can\u2019t send picture because my mother doesn\u2019t live close to me.Very disappointed","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-21","r":5.0,"t":"The product es very good.. Actually I am using all day","x":"I can not speak english.  The product es very good.. Actually I am using all day, beacuse in my country is raining a lot,","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-22","r":5.0,"t":"nice quality","x":"I purchased this for my elderly mother and was replacing an old one just like this one.  Does the job.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-23","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect gift.","x":"I gave this as a gift. Durable and easy to use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B00023J4AW-24","r":4.0,"t":"It keeps me dry","x":"It\u2019s quite large and roomy-even for my dreads!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Customers find it convenient to keep in a purse or pocket for rain protection, and many describe it as a nostalgic, old-style product that serves its purpose.","cites":[1,2,4,9,10,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it is too small or skimpy, with insufficient coverage in the back and front.","cites":[7,8,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some customers note it looks odd or ridiculous but still works for keeping hair dry.","cites":[1,4,6,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers with thick or large curly hair report it is big enough to cover their hair without smushing it.","cites":[3]},{"text":"A few customers criticize the plastic as cheap and flimsy and question the odd tie design.","cites":[6,14]}]},"qa":[]}